              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akawaambia, “Mnifuate, maana Mwenyezi-Mungu amewatia adui zenu Wamoabu mikononi mwenu.” Wakamfuata mpaka kivuko cha Yordani na kukiteka toka mikononi mwa Wamoabu, wakazuia mtu yeyote kupita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo, wakawaua Wamoabu wapatao 10,000; watu wote wenye afya na nguvu, wala hakuna hata mmoja aliyenusurika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo Waisraeli wakawashinda Wamoabu. Nchi ikawa na amani kwa muda wa miaka themanini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
